cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or its results, please cite both the manuscript and this repository."
title: "Machine learning vs logistic regression for malignancy risk in thyroid nodules — code and aggregate results"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-04-23"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.19707930"
abstract: >
  Code, aggregate metrics and figures supporting a temporal validation study
  comparing five machine-learning classifiers (logistic regression, random
  forest, XGBoost, bagged CART and a multi-layer perceptron) for malignancy
  risk prediction in thyroid nodules. Patient-level data are not included
  in this repository; see data/README.md for the institutional access policy.
